WEBVTT

00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:31.663
the cyber-war 
will be part of our future.

00:00:31.829 --> 00:00:37.037
We will fight our enemies remotely thanks 
to new weapons classes such as viruses

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:40.162
or programmes that can harm
our enemy operational capacity.

00:00:40.746 --> 00:00:45.412
The cyber-war is not covered
in the existing law frameworks

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:49.787
and the definition of
the cyber-war is still highly debated.

00:00:50.121 --> 00:00:54.996
So, how can we react to a cyber-war
if we can’t even agree on its meaning?

00:00:54.996 --> 00:00:56.912
One way to start would be

00:00:56.912 --> 00:01:00.537
picturing some situations where new 
international laws could be necessary.